            </div>
            <div type="commentary">
                <p>The fragment was discovered in the loose filling below the modern floor of the naos during the restoration work by DAC in 1989 (Larnaca District Archaeological Museum, Sotera Metamorphosis 1989, tray 7). Originally, it may have accompanied the figure of David (<ref target="MedCY.055.016.html">MedCY.055.016</ref>), given the strong similarity in the colour of the letters and the background between the fragment and the extant mural.</p>
            </div>
